    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord and More!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay tuned for  news and share your feedback, please follow us on Discord and more:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/882317164e36eac29a52a5948236b57a.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: Stargate Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitter(X): @STARIO_HavenTow</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reddit:\u00a0r/stariohaventower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TikTok:\u00a0@stario_haventower</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/8cd6044fc294c27d7678fd19d9bc3a0e.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/d2f0c9f1054005a2485ca6bbcfbc74f0.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1e2d9e953ad403990debe499839d486d.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1e2d9e953ad403990debe499839d486d.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1e2d9e953ad403990debe499839d486d.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sandstorm apocalypse looms. In search of the prophecy\u2019s final hope, survivors band together to climb toward the clouds. Abandon the boundless wasteland, break gravity\u2019s chains. Upward, until the tower cleaves the heavens and reaches the rebirth of its honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/9cb5e27510033d2e831615f339fee9f3.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor houses its own storage. Upper-layer construction stalls when supplies run dry, while lower-layer towertizens panic when rations are insufficient. Passages for manpower, pipelines for fluids, hot-air balloon routes... Advance the tech tree to marshal resources and forge a logistics empire that spans every layer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/e767fc51333b6d55d56fc27d1bb22f0c.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/cca1d483f59e86c957050e73e05248b2.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/cca1d483f59e86c957050e73e05248b2.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/cca1d483f59e86c957050e73e05248b2.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your tower ascends steep and daring, reinforce its frame with brace technology and carve out horizontal space. Suspended high-altitude gardens and net-like sky platforms defy gravity, showcasing the boundless creativity that upholds your city in the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/2fb9d563c2853d1a909eabbf81f0f508.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a8f17909b721fbe4852ae4b51cccea13.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a8f17909b721fbe4852ae4b51cccea13.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a8f17909b721fbe4852ae4b51cccea13.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From the desert floor through swirling haze and acid rain, ascend upward to explore ever-changing ecosystems. Confront the hazards and seize the opportunities that each new layer brings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/58d5edb39ffe2bf25380de827781a916.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/0e8f6847df38254ff90672e25081fda8.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/0e8f6847df38254ff90672e25081fda8.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/0e8f6847df38254ff90672e25081fda8.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One misstep among the endless climb can corrode both the tower and its dwellers\u2019 will. Craft awe-inspiring landmarks to meet your towertizens\u2019 practical and emotional needs, boosting morale and productivity. Every masterpiece landmark stands as a beacon of hope, lighting the path toward the stars.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/8cd6044fc294c27d7678fd19d9bc3a0e.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/d2f0c9f1054005a2485ca6bbcfbc74f0.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1e2d9e953ad403990debe499839d486d.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1e2d9e953ad403990debe499839d486d.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1e2d9e953ad403990debe499839d486d.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sandstorm apocalypse looms. In search of the prophecy\u2019s final hope, survivors band together to climb toward the clouds. Abandon the boundless wasteland, break gravity\u2019s chains. Upward, until the tower cleaves the heavens and reaches the rebirth of its honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/9cb5e27510033d2e831615f339fee9f3.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.poster.a