ragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/2fb9d563c2853d1a909eabbf81f0f508.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a8f17909b721fbe4852ae4b51cccea13.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a8f17909b721fbe4852ae4b51cccea13.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a8f17909b721fbe4852ae4b51cccea13.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From the desert floor through swirling haze and acid rain, ascend upward to explore ever-changing ecosystems. Confront the hazards and seize the opportunities that each new layer brings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/58d5edb39ffe2bf25380de827781a916.webp?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/0e8f6847df38254ff90672e25081fda8.poster.avif?t=1753175579\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/0e8f6847df38254ff90672e25081fda8.webm?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/0e8f6847df38254ff90672e25081fda8.mp4?t=1753175579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One misstep among the endless climb can corrode both the tower and its dwellers\u2019 will. Craft awe-inspiring landmarks to meet your towertizens\u2019 practical and emotional needs, boosting morale and productivity. Every masterpiece landmark stands as a beacon of hope, lighting the path toward the stars.</p>",
